Subject: [mistral.rs] tool-calls-while-reasoning

  Tool-call parsing while the model is still reasoning, the sampling-site hooks the eval recorder needs, and an ordered tool schema — the template renders it into the prompt, so a map whose iteration order varies per instance re-renders the tools block on every request and defeats prefix reuse.

Applies to: 962112d18ea5729fe7acaae5085ce54c2fb66dab
Files: 5

